<title>USA: Digi Intl Inc Q4 Sept 30 net off.</title>
<headline>Digi Intl Inc Q4 Sept 30 net off.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.22		    $0.38</p>
