<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Preliminary, unaudited results reflect Digi's investment in AetherWorks Corp. The company is assessing its position on accounting for the investment. If Digi consolidates the results, or uses the equity method of accounting, Digi estimates its share of the operating losses of AetherWorks for the year ended September 30, 1996 would be in a range of $0.15 to $0.20 per Digi share.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
